OL,3,AFour ways Labour could raise money in
OL,4,Athe Budget without hiking income tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe're likely to hear a lot about the
OL,7,Fchancellor's "headroom" in this Budget.
OL,9,FThat is the cash buffer the government
OL,10,Fhas to help meet its own fiscal rules
OL,11,Fand reduce borrowing.
OL,13,FEconomists think the buffer might have
OL,14,Fhalved in the last six months from
OL,15,Faround #24bn to as low as #11bn, in
OL,16,Fpart because of rising interest rates
OL,17,Fthe government has been paying to
OL,18,Fborrow money from private investors.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
